.work/
# Bulky or regenerable profiler output: raw profiles, folded stacks, per-request traces, fetched
# pages. The committed results keep the rendered flamegraphs (.svg), rollups (.top.md, .txt) and
# JSON summaries.
results/**/raw/
results/**/*.folded
results/**/trace-*.txt
results/**/io-*.log
results/**/*.html
__pycache__/
# Full allocation-site listings (~2 MB per alloc gate run of eight). The gate reads only the JSON
# summaries; the listings regenerate from the same binaries. Files already committed stay.
results/**/*.alloc_objects.txt
results/**/*.alloc_space.txt
